{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方最大号的白字与薄荷绿重点词，随后视线容易被左下方同样醒目的大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"两人正处于亲近相处的当下，他暂时不想考虑以后，只想舒服地待在这份亲近里。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、安静；是否同时有疏离感，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"心慢慢漂远的反差；想表达有多喜欢、询问对方是否也一样，却没能开口，念头逐渐淡去。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"上方单块较长，包含亲近、舒适、沉默和内心漂远等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心的舒适与漂远、喜欢与犹豫分散在上下两块，需要拼接才能完整理解。\",\n    \"中间小字连续三行，增加辅助信息的扫读负担。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1d09d99a-b594-443a-9249-ca5f3fd7b503", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011348870831Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:14:29.208152+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5f2bddef9e70af6be0486c6dfe1ba09c928a58547cac27aac67981b511cc7cb2", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp